    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p><p>When riding large <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Beasts\" title=\"Beasts\">Beasts</a> such as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sith_Warbird\" title=\"Sith Warbird\">Sith Warbirds</a>, the Sith frequently use special battle harnesses, turning the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Beasts\" title=\"Beasts\">Beasts</a> into mobile weapon platforms. The Sith Battle Harness features a cockpit that provides the rider <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Improved_Cover\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Improved Cover\">Improved Cover</a>, and the special reins grant a +2 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ride\" title=\"Ride\">Ride</a> checks. In addition, the mount gains a +4 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to it's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> and it's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a>. The Sith Battle Harness also has a built-in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Blaster_Cannon\" title=\"Blaster Cannon\">Blaster Cannon</a>, powered by an onboard <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Generator\" title=\"Power Generator\">Power Generator</a> providing unlimited ammunition. </p>",
